		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>30-foot-long mobile vine ending in a flytrap maw. Traps victims in pods which turn them into sproutlings.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 39, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +7 (2d6 + pod trap), <strong>MV</strong> none, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> -3, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Pod Spawn</strong>. Seed pod containing a dead creature sprouts as a moonflower in 1d4 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pod Trap</strong>. Victim is spat out near, trapped in seed pod. STR 15+ on turn to break free, 2d6 damage per turn.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
